00:00:14,090 --> 00:00:14,090
[Verse 1]

2
00:00:14,090 --> 00:00:20,199
Oris encontró en el suelo un pajarito sin vuelo.

3
00:00:20,199 --> 00:00:29,133
Sus antenitas brillaron, ¡bip, bip, bip!, le avisaron.

4
00:00:29,133 --> 00:00:29,133
[Chorus]

5
00:00:29,133 --> 00:00:32,034
Pío, pío, pajarito,

6
00:00:32,034 --> 00:00:35,104
no estés triste, chiquitito,

7
00:00:35,104 --> 00:00:38,333
a tu nido volverás,

8
00:00:38,333 --> 00:00:43,805
con tu mamá estarás.

9
00:00:43,805 --> 00:00:43,805
[Verse 2]

10
00:00:43,805 --> 00:00:46,667
Luna ladra: ¡Guau, cuidado!

11
00:00:46,667 --> 00:00:49,662
Busca un grande a tu lado.

12
00:00:49,662 --> 00:00:52,490
Con cariño lo subieron

13
00:00:52,490 --> 00:00:58,331
